<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1711_6273.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unnseren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">früntlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gruoß</unclear>, sampt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wz</unclear> wir liebs
<lb n="2"/>unnd guots vermoegendt, zuvor <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">from</unclear>, fürsichtig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrsam</unclear>
<lb n="3"/>wyß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">innsonders</unclear> guot fründt unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwe</unclear> lieb <orgName resp="#ner">Eydt-
<lb n="4"/>gnossen</orgName>. Wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zwyfflendt</unclear> nit, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">khundt</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">offenbar</unclear>
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">syn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werde</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wz</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uffrüstungen</unclear> ettliche der <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Eydt-
<lb n="6"/>gnoschafft</orgName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">benachpartten</unclear> fürsten unnd Potentaten
<lb n="7"/>unnd sonderlich der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Künig</unclear> Inn <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-280" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hyspannia</unclear></placeName> unnd
<lb n="8"/>Hertzog inn <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-437" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Savöy</placeName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">iez</unclear> ein zyt daher <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsin</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear> unnd
<lb n="9"/>ob wir woll die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zyt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haer</unclear> nit mercken noch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erfharen</unclear>
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">khoennen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wz</unclear> ir vorhaben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gsin</unclear>, So werden wir doch
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ietzundt</unclear>, vonn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einer</unclear> stundt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zur</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andren</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gwüssen</unclear>
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">underschiedtlichen</unclear> ortten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">har</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">glöublich</unclear> berichtet unnd
<lb n="13"/>gewarnet, dz <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">es</unclear> uf <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> Statt unnd Landt
<lb n="14"/>unnd Lütt, sonderlich inn der <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-31" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Waad</placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abgän</unclear>, unnd
<lb n="15"/>wir vor dem Hertzog inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Savöy</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vyändtlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ange</unclear>-
<lb n="16"/>fallen unnd überzogen werden söllind, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">diwyl</unclear>
<lb n="17"/>wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">puntsahalben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwandt</unclear>, mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear> uff
<lb n="18"/>unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guoten</unclear> huot <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stehindt</unclear>, unnd nit wenig vertruwen
<lb n="19"/>und zuoversicht zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> habendt unnd tragendt, haben
<lb n="20"/>wir üch disen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorstanden</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">warnenden</unclear>
<lb n="21"/>geffar, fründt: unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnössisch</unclear> bericht machen
<lb n="22"/>unnd beneben bitten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wöllen</unclear> ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wöllindt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnserem</unclear>
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hochen</unclear> unnd guotten vertruwen nach, so wir zuo üch
<lb n="24"/>habendt, ein getrüw <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oug</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uffsehen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unns</unclear>
<lb n="25"/>haben, die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üweren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gerüst</unclear> halten, uf dz wo wir
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">betröuwter</unclear> massen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vonn</unclear> dem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fyändt</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ann</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dem</unclear>
<lb n="27"/>einen oder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andren</unclear> ort angriffen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wurdendt</unclear>, ir
<lb n="28"/>uns mit üwer getrüwen hilff fürderlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuospringen</unclear>
<lb n="29"/>unnd dz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ienig</unclear> gegen uns bewysen unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">leysten</unclear>
<lb n="30"/>mögindt, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wz</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuosamen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">habende</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Pündtnuß</unclear>
<lb n="31"/>vermag und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuogibt</unclear>, als wir uns zuo üch deß wol
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versehendt</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tröstendt</unclear>, und nit minder gegen üch
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesinnet</unclear> sindt, wo üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etwz</unclear> geffar zuostan sölte (die
<lb n="34"/>doch Gott der Allmechtig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnädig</unclear> vonn üch unnd
<lb n="35"/>uns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abwenden</unclear>) unnd inn synem guoten schirm
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erhaltten</unclear> wölle. Datum <origDate when="1611-02-08" resp="#ner">8. Febr: 1611</origDate>.
<lb n="37"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-514" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schuldtheiß</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rhatt</unclear>
<lb n="38"/>der Statt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Bernn</unclear></orgName>.
